<title>UK: Third Brent date kept - traders.</title>
<headline>Third Brent date kept - traders.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The third Brent date nominated from the paper chains on Friday was kept ahead of the five o'clock deadline, traders said.</p>
<p>The Feb 9-11 loader was kept by Wall Street trader J.Aron, they said.</p>
<p>Two other Brent cargoes turning wet on Friday were kept early and onsold.</p>
<p>A Feb 9-11 cargo was traded at Feb Brent +2 cents, and a Feb 10-12 loader was sold at March Brent +48 cents.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
</text>
